{
  "_meta": {
    "source": "https://www.tesla.com/api/energy/supercharger/pricing?countryCode={CC}&productType=SuperCharger[&stateCode={SC}]",
    "harvested": "2026-08-01",
    "description": "Full pricing records for all 32 live Supercharger-for-Business markets. US pricing is per-state (see sfb-pricing-harvest.json usStates); every other market is national.",
    "api_semantics": "stateCode is REQUIRED and validated for US only (a bogus US state returns HTTP 500). Outside the US the parameter is ignored entirely - bogus, empty or omitted all return the same national record. A 500 therefore means the market is not configured, never a wrong region code.",
    "method": "same-origin fetch from a logged-in browser tab (Akamai-gated; curl/automation get 403)",
    "coverage": "Swept all 249 ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 codes: 31 non-US returned pricing, 217 returned 500, US requires a stateCode.",
    "changes_since_2026_06_13": [
      "US: no change. All 51 jurisdictions and all 8 flat-cost fields identical to the June 13 pull.",
      "PL: averageEnergyCost 0.45 -> 0.95 PLN/kWh (+111%). The old value understated Polish commercial power by ~2x - same class of Tesla data error as the earlier Maine and Norway bugs. Payback moves 1.65 -> 2.64 yr at medium install.",
      "HU: scTeslaFeePPU 31.25 -> 30.87 HUF/kWh and hardware 13,480,000 -> 13,305,225 HUF (both ~-1.3%, consistent with an FX re-peg of Tesla's USD baseline). Payback 2.47 -> 2.44 yr.",
      "LI: NEW market, not tested in any prior harvest. Shares the Swiss hardware/install baseline but has its own energy cost, sell price, utilization and fee. Priced only - no public page.",
      "Launch status: 28 of 32 markets now serve a localized configurator page, up from 11 on Jun 4. Newly 200: PL PT FI IE DK RO GR HU CZ SI SK HR LT (confirmed 404 in June) plus CH LU IS IL (June 404s were flagged as possibly-wrong-locale, so their launch date is unknown)."
    ],
